Being hungry on a weekend is extremely dangerous[. When] Zomato and[ Sw]iggy are just a touch away, things could get complicated[ if you] act on an impulse. The consequences are frightening. So we should exercise utmost caution, and also perhaps (senior) adult supervision , while adding items to our cart.
